{
	"summary": "A ring gauge that counts up from 0 to 94 on mount, with a text label that changes with the value.",
	"use": "Animating a score or health metric on load and pairing it with a verdict label.",
	"spec": [
		"`let value = $state(0)` incremented in `onMount` by `Math.min(value + 2, 94)` every 40 ms via `setInterval`",
		"`<GaugeChart {value} variant=\"ring\"` with `height=\"260px\"`",
		"`formatter={(v) => String(Math.round(v))}` rounds the displayed number",
		"`const label = $derived(value < 40 ? 'Needs work' : value <= 70 ? 'Good' : 'Excellent')`",
		"`<Stack gap=\"3\">` stacks the gauge above `<p class=\"label\">{label}</p>`",
		"Interval is cleared when `value >= 94` and on unmount"
	],
	"tags": ["gauge-chart", "ring", "counter", "animation", "onmount", "score", "stack"],
	"shape": "square",
	"index": {
		"kind": "component",
		"subtype": "chart",
		"industry": ["devtools", "saas"],
		"style": ["default"],
		"motion": "expressive",
		"interaction": ["hover"],
		"layout": "stack",
		"colorMode": "both",
		"density": "regular",
		"tech": ["css"],
		"cost": "css",
		"components": ["Card", "Stack", "GaugeChart"],
		"aliases": ["animated score", "count up gauge", "progress ring"],
		"related": ["195", "196", "197"],
		"a11y": {
			"reducedMotion": true,
			"keyboard": false
		},
		"added": "2026-10-16"
	}
}
